00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:47.500
The variable has changed

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:51.500
His health is the priority

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.592
The system must be optimized

00:00:55.652 --> 00:00:57.693
For sustainability

00:00:59.589 --> 00:01:03.500
The new normal is 6 AM!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.800
A new alarm, a brand new plan

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.815
Route 1 Local, a slower pace

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:15.500
A 45-minute ride, a safer space

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.000
A 15-minute wait is all we get

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.440
A logical and warm asset

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.000
This is the system, this is the shield

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.803
The old inefficiency must yield!

00:01:29.803 --> 00:01:36.727
